# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Keep transient nested lockfiles ignored. The root workspace lock is an
# authenticated release input and must be committed with the source tree.
**/Cargo.lock
!/Cargo.lock
# Ignore local JSON corpora and generated tapes used in tests
crates/norito/tests/corpora/*.json
crates/norito/tests/corpora/*.tape
crates/iroha_test_network/.iroha_test_network_run.json

# Dashboard telemetry outputs (real data)
dashboards/data/*.json
!dashboards/data/*.sample.json

# Fixture regeneration metadata
artifacts/*.json

# Local executable (repo root)
/priv

# Deployment manifests are signed with runtime-only operator material and must
# be regenerated for the exact deployable artifact rather than checked in.
/demo/*.deploy.manifest.json

# Runtime output from the interactive setup wizard (may contain private keys).
/wizard-output/

# Relay tests and local runs create tempfile-backed replay stores and links in
# either the repository root or the relay crate, depending on the test cwd.
/.tmp*
tools/soranet-relay/.tmp*
